# Setting combinations, Professional rows (TC-238 – TC-254, R2-g2): as combo-price.steps, but taps 「Professional」 first
# (a 3.2 s selection is under the 02:30 cap, so no toast and the selection stays whole), then the style, fps and
# Resolution chips, reads the rate line, then drags the right handle to the left handle (1 s) and back to the end
# (3.2 s), reading the CTA price each time. Charges nothing: Enhance is not tapped.
# Starts / ends: as combo-price.steps (panel just opened with ve-real-000320-720p30, Standard, whole video selected).
# Args: $1 = case ID, $2 = style chip id, $3 = fps chip id, $4 = resolution chip id.
case $1
fingerdrag 540 1750 540 1250 10
id chip_mode_professional
expect-not "supports clips|Shorten your selection"
id $2
id $3
id $4
wait 1
els chip_
els tv_charge
shot $1-chips
fingerdrag 540 1250 540 1750 10
wait 1
fingerdrag 980 1158 100 1158 20
wait 1
els tv_
shot $1-1s
fingerdrag 416 1158 1060 1158 15
wait 2
els tv_
shot $1-full
